WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.629 --> 00:00:24.098
BERKELEY CITY COUNCIL DECLARED

00:00:22.997 --> 00:00:24.799
THE WORLD IN A QUOTE CLIMATE

00:00:24.231 --> 00:00:26.667
EMERGENCY.

00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:27.802
THEY CALLED FOR A PUSH TO HALT

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:30.604
ALL CARBON EMISSIONS WORLDWIDE

00:00:27.935 --> 00:00:32.973
AND SAID GOVERNMENTS MUST MAKE

00:00:30.738 --> 00:00:33.808
EFFORTS TO "HUMANELY STABILIZE

00:00:33.107 --> 00:00:35.976
POPULATION.

00:00:33.941 --> 00:00:39.380
THAT'S A PHRASE WHICH

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:40.981
ROBESPIERRE WOULD SURELY LOVE.

00:00:39.513 --> 00:00:43.384
THANKS SO MUCH FOR COMING ON.

00:00:41.115 --> 00:00:45.086
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME, TUCKER.

00:00:43.517 --> 00:00:47.288
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO I'M A PRETTY

00:00:45.219 --> 00:00:48.289
LITERAL PERSON, IF THEY SAY

00:00:47.421 --> 00:00:49.190
CLIMATE EMERGENCY, THAT SOUNDS

00:00:48.422 --> 00:00:51.625
RIGHT TO ME.

00:00:49.323 --> 00:00:53.994
SO IF IT'S AN ACTUAL EMERGENCY,

00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:55.196
WHY DOES ANYONE IN BERKELEY HAVE

00:00:54.128 --> 00:00:56.230
AN AIR CONDITIONER?

00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:57.631
I HATE TO SORT OF ACTS THAT

00:00:56.363 --> 00:00:58.566
PEOPLE LIVE OUT THEIR PURPORTED

00:00:57.765 --> 00:00:59.967
BELIEFS, BUT IF THEY ARE TELLING

00:00:58.699 --> 00:01:02.369
THE REST OF US WE NEED TO HAVE

00:01:00.101 --> 00:01:04.972
FEWER KIDS, WHY ARE THEY STILL

00:01:02.503 --> 00:01:07.575
DRIVING AND USING THE AC?

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:08.242
&gt;&gt; I TOTALLY BELIEVE YOU, TUCKER

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.578
BUT I DON'T THINK THEY ARE

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:12.079
TELLING US TO HAVE LESS BABIES.

00:01:10.711 --> 00:01:13.981
CLIMATE CHANGE AND THE IMPACT

00:01:12.213 --> 00:01:15.449
THAT HUMAN BEINGS HAVE ON

00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:15.816
ENVIRONMENT IS RELATED TO A LOT

00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:16.984
OF STUFF.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:20.187
NOT JUST THE AMOUNT OF CHILDREN

00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:21.589
THAT WE ARE HAVING BUT CARBON

00:01:20.321 --> 00:01:22.957
EMISSIONS AND EATING LESS MEAT.

00:01:21.722 --> 00:01:24.658
I THINK WE CAN ALL AGREE THAT WE

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:29.430
CARE ABOUT OUR PLANET BUT IT'S

00:01:24.792 --> 00:01:30.097
NOT ABOUT HAVING LESS CHILDREN.

00:01:29.563 --> 00:01:31.999
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AND I DON'T THINK

00:01:30.231 --> 00:01:33.200
IT IS.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:35.169
&gt;&gt; ARE WE AGREEING?

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:36.403
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NO, I SAID THE IDEA

00:01:35.302 --> 00:01:38.939
IS INSANE AND GROTESQUE AND IT'S

00:01:36.537 --> 00:01:45.246
A WINDOW INTO WHAT THIS REALLY

00:01:39.073 --> 00:01:48.349
IS, WHICH IS -- &gt;&gt; THEY AREN'T

00:01:45.379 --> 00:01:50.651
SAYING IT'S AN EMERGENCY,

00:01:48.482 --> 00:01:51.652
EVERYONE HAS STOMACH AND STOP

00:01:50.785 --> 00:01:52.620
HAVING BABIES.

00:01:51.786 --> 00:01:56.023
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT HOLD ON.

00:01:52.753 --> 00:01:56.824
IF THEY ARE SAYING AND IT'S AN

00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:58.192
EMERGENCY, PRESUMABLY THEY

00:01:57.091 --> 00:02:01.195
BELIEVE IT IS.

00:01:58.325 --> 00:02:03.230
SO HOW CAN THEY JUSTIFY WRITING

00:02:01.328 --> 00:02:04.265
BIASES, HAVING CARS,

00:02:03.364 --> 00:02:07.034
REFRIGERATORS, ANY ACTIVITY THAT

00:02:04.398 --> 00:02:08.869
ADDS TO THE SUM TOTAL OF CO2

00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:10.204
EMISSIONS?

00:02:09.003 --> 00:02:10.805
WHY ARE THEY STILL COMMITTING

00:02:10.337 --> 00:02:13.440
THESE ACTIVITIES?

00:02:10.938 --> 00:02:14.642
WHY SHOULD I LISTEN AND TAKE

00:02:13.574 --> 00:02:15.409
ANYONE SERIOUSLY WHO IS DRIVING

00:02:14.775 --> 00:02:19.747
A CAR AND SIMULTANEOUSLY TELLING

00:02:15.543 --> 00:02:21.982
ME NOT TO HAVE MORE KIDS?

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:22.583
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK THEY ARE SAYING

00:02:22.116 --> 00:02:25.553
THAT.

00:02:22.716 --> 00:02:28.589
IT'S A COMBINATION OF FACTORS.

00:02:25.686 --> 00:02:31.025
AND IT'S A COMPLEX ENVIRONMENT.

00:02:28.722 --> 00:02:33.561
I THINK IN GENERAL, THE YOUNGER

00:02:31.158 --> 00:02:34.628
GENERATION, THE MILLENNIALS, ARE

00:02:33.694 --> 00:02:34.995
BECOMING MORE ENVIRONMENTALLY

00:02:34.762 --> 00:02:36.864
CAUTIOUS.

00:02:35.129 --> 00:02:39.433
I THINK THE TECHNOLOGY IS

00:02:36.997 --> 00:02:40.668
CATCHING UP TO THE FACT THAT

00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:41.035
PEOPLE ARE BECOMING MORE

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:43.437
CONSCIOUS?

00:02:41.168 --> 00:02:44.171
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IF PEOPLE ARE MUCH

00:02:43.571 --> 00:02:46.640
POORER BECAUSE THEY ARE DEEPLY

00:02:44.305 --> 00:02:47.641
IN STUDENT LOAN DEBT FOR DEGREES

00:02:46.774 --> 00:02:49.743
THAT MEAN NOTHING BECAUSE THEY

00:02:47.775 --> 00:02:51.512
HAVE BOUGHT INTO THE SYSTEM THAT

00:02:49.877 --> 00:02:53.214
IS ESSENTIAL AND DOWN LIKE A

00:02:51.645 --> 00:02:57.852
SOCIALLY FRAUDULENT, AND THEY

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:58.752
HAVE NO MONEY.

00:02:57.985 --> 00:02:59.753
THEY ARE ENVIRONMENTALLY

00:02:58.886 --> 00:03:02.089
CONSCIOUS, BUT THEY ARE POOR.

00:02:59.887 --> 00:03:03.157
&gt;&gt; THAT'S ONE PART OF IT, BUT

00:03:02.223 --> 00:03:03.991
THERE'S MORE THAN ONE FACTOR

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:08.162
WHEN IT COMES TO CLIMATE CHANGE

00:03:04.124 --> 00:03:08.796
AND WHAT WE CAN DO TO REDUCE OUR

00:03:08.295 --> 00:03:10.664
IMPACT.

00:03:08.929 --> 00:03:12.433
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I AM ACTUALLY IN

00:03:10.798 --> 00:03:14.802
FAVOR OF A CLEAN ENVIRONMENT.

00:03:12.566 --> 00:03:15.236
SO I WONDER WHY, HAVE YOU

00:03:14.935 --> 00:03:16.704
NOTICED THIS?

00:03:15.369 --> 00:03:18.038
PLACES THAT SPEND OF THE MOST

00:03:16.837 --> 00:03:19.640
ENERGY TELLING THE REST OF US

00:03:18.172 --> 00:03:22.743
THAT THE WORLD IS ENDING BECAUSE

00:03:19.773 --> 00:03:24.845
OF CLIMATE CHANGE ALSO TEND TO

00:03:22.877 --> 00:03:25.546
HAVE THE DIRTY STREETS AND THE

00:03:24.979 --> 00:03:27.381
LARGEST NUMBER OF PEOPLE

00:03:25.679 --> 00:03:29.216
RELIEVING THEMSELVES ON THE

00:03:27.514 --> 00:03:31.018
SIDEWALK, AND THE MOST TRASH?

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.019
IF YOU CARE ABOUT THE

00:03:31.151 --> 00:03:35.189
ENVIRONMENT, MAYBE YOU SHOULD

00:03:32.152 --> 00:03:36.056
CLEAN UP IN FRONT OF CITY HALL.

00:03:35.322 --> 00:03:37.725
DOES THAT OCCUR TO LIBERALS?

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:39.426
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT JUST LIBERALS THAT

00:03:37.858 --> 00:03:40.828
ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR CLIMATE

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:42.229
CHANGE, IT'S ALL OF US.

00:03:40.961 --> 00:03:45.099
AND I AGREE WITH YOU, WE CAN'T

00:03:42.363 --> 00:03:46.867
JUST TALK THE TALK, WE HAVE TO

00:03:45.232 --> 00:03:47.668
FOLLOW UP WITH ACTIONS.

00:03:47.801 --> 00:03:51.472
YOU CARE ABOUT THE ENVIRONMENT

00:03:50.271 --> 00:03:54.174
AND MAKING THE WORLD A

00:03:51.605 --> 00:03:54.475
CLEANER -- AND CLEARLY I AM FOR

00:03:54.308 --> 00:03:57.478
THAT.

00:03:54.608 --> 00:03:58.579
&gt;&gt; WE AGREE WITH THAT, WE ALL

00:03:57.611 --> 00:03:59.213
WANT TO KEEP THE ENVIRONMENT

00:03:58.712 --> 00:04:02.883
CLEANER.

00:03:59.346 --> 00:04:03.384
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HAVE YOU BEEN TO

00:04:03.017 --> 00:04:04.084
