00:04:04.218 --> 00:04:05.619
SAN FRANCISCO?

00:04:04.718 --> 00:04:08.188
THERE ARE PEOPLE RELIEVING

00:04:05.886 --> 00:04:10.357
THEMSELVES ON THE SIDEWALK AND

00:04:08.322 --> 00:04:11.158
THEN WALKING AROUND THEM ARE

00:04:10.624 --> 00:04:13.093
ENVIRONMENTALISTS WANTING TO

00:04:11.292 --> 00:04:13.394
LECTURE ME ABOUT HOW MANY KIDS I

00:04:13.227 --> 00:04:16.130
HAVE.

00:04:13.527 --> 00:04:18.832
&gt;&gt; BUT YOU KNOW WHAT, IT'S NOT

00:04:16.263 --> 00:04:20.668
NECESSARILY ABOUT WHERE IN THE

00:04:18.966 --> 00:04:23.003
WORLD IS MORE POPULATED, IT'S

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:23.604
ABOUT WHO IS USING MORE

00:04:23.137 --> 00:04:25.506
RESOURCES.

00:04:23.904 --> 00:04:26.807
AND I AGREE WITH YOU THAT WE

00:04:25.639 --> 00:04:27.641
HAVE TO DO MUCH BETTER.

00:04:26.941 --> 00:04:28.842
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DO YOU AGREE THAT

00:04:27.775 --> 00:04:31.245
IF WE ARE GOING TO MAKE THE

00:04:28.976 --> 00:04:32.646
WORLD CLEANER, WE COULD START BY

00:04:31.378 --> 00:04:33.948
