00:04:37.685 --> 00:04:41.121
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK IT CAN BE

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:43.257
EITHER OR, IT'S EVERY DAY.

00:04:41.255 --> 00:04:44.325
SPEAK ONE WAY OR THE CITIES WITH

00:04:43.757 --> 00:04:46.527
THE MOST OPEN AND AGGRESSIVE

00:04:44.525 --> 00:04:47.895
COMMITMENT TO THE ENVIRONMENT

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:53.267
THE DIRTIEST?

00:04:48.028 --> 00:04:54.435
WHY IS PORTLAND, OREGON, A

