&gt;&gt; THAT'S NOT TRUE.

00:04:55.102 --> 00:04:57.071
I'M NOT TALKING SPECIFICALLY

00:04:56.337 --> 00:04:58.605
ABOUT PORTLAND, BUT NOT ALL

00:04:57.204 --> 00:05:00.174
CITIES THAT ARE SAYING THAT WE

00:04:58.739 --> 00:05:02.509
NEED TO DO BETTER ABOUT OUR

00:05:00.307 --> 00:05:06.213
ENVIRONMENT ARE FILTHY.

00:05:02.643 --> 00:05:07.381
WE ARE YOU GETTING THAT FROM?

00:05:06.347 --> 00:05:08.882
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OKAY.

00:05:07.514 --> 00:05:11.785
TRACK WITH ME REALLY QUICK JUST

00:05:09.016 --> 00:05:13.988
FOR THIS ONE QUESTION.

00:05:11.919 --> 00:05:15.189
IF YOU SAY YOU CARE ABOUT THE

00:05:14.121 --> 00:05:16.590
